 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "When my husband was going into the dining room this morning, he dropped some coins on the floor.",
   "zh": "今天早晨我丈夫走进饭厅时，把一些硬币掉在地上了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 7.2,
    "end": 14.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "There were coins everywhere.",
   "zh": "到处都是硬币。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 14.9,
    "end": 17.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "We looked for them, but we could not find them all.",
   "zh": "我们虽然找了，但没能把它们全部找到。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 17.5,
    "end": 22.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "While we were having breakfast, our little boy, Tommy, found two small coins on the floor.",
   "zh": "正当我们吃早饭时，我们的小男孩汤米在地上找到了两枚小硬币。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 22.3,
    "end": 31.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He put them both into his mouth.",
   "zh": "他把这两枚硬币全都放进了嘴里。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 31.4,
    "end": 34.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "We both tried to get the coins, but it was too late.",
   "zh": "我们俩都试图把这两枚硬币拿出来，但太迟了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 34.7,
    "end": 39.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Tommy had already swallowed them!",
   "zh": "汤米已经把硬币咽了下去！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 39.5,
    "end": 43.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Later that morning, when I was doing the housework, my husband phoned me from the office.",
   "zh": "那天上午的晚些时候，当我正做家务时，我丈夫从办公室打来电话。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 43.4,
    "end": 50.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'How's Tommy?' he asked.",
   "zh": "“汤米怎么样？”他问。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 50.2,
    "end": 53.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'I don't know,' I answered,",
   "zh": "“我不知道，”我回答说，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 53.1,
    "end": 55.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Tommy's been to the toilet three times this morning, but I haven't had any change yet!'",
   "zh": "“今天上午汤米去了 3 次厕所了，但我还没看到硬币！”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L117.mp4",
    "start": 55.7,
    "end": 63
   }
  }
 ],
